買収阻む壁","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSBB340RSBBUHBI00YM.html"},{"title":"「違反を確信、勝訴のチャンスある」 米大統領ら提訴の日鉄が会見","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST170215T17ULFA00FM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00809","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"ロサンゼルスの山火事","date":"2025-01-24T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"アメリカ・カリフォルニア州ロサンゼルス近郊で起きた大規模な山火事は、空気の乾燥が被害を拡大させた一因だと指摘されています。この乾燥には、気候変動が影響したとも言われています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":730,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/los-angeles-wildfires","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=c348d627-366b-4084-a13f-b268005dd260","https://open.spotify.com/episode/1TGu5YKNV13lqxYKvaeac4","https://pca.st/episode/567c30ca-e240-4df6-b9ee-679aa341b50e","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/dj4rpahq"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST192RK2T19ULBH007M.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST1B24X6T1BUHBI012M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"ロス山火事、乾燥に気候変動の影響も 識者が指摘する対策の難しさ","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST192RK2T19ULBH007M.html"},{"title":"ロス山火事、乾期長く「燃料」蓄積か 気候変動で世界でも火災リスク","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST1B24X6T1BUHBI012M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00810","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"春闘","date":"2025-01-23T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"春闘とは、働く人でつくる労働組合が、企業などの経営者に、賃金の引き上げなど待遇の改善を求めることです。労組の中央組織である「連合」や産業別組織が大枠の要求方針をつくり、その後、企業ごとの労組が具体的な要求を掲げて経営側と交渉します。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":701,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/shuntou","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=823c87f0-c3d4-475e-892a-b268005dacd7","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4jrkQvEVkP0FFKAbAFklZC","https://pca.st/episode/89ab8c70-ad52-4ef3-a02d-9f1174534bd5","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/xbx2n4as"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS1R6CXRS1RULFA020.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】春闘ってなに？ 歴史的な物価高、賃上げ注目","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS1R6CXRS1RULFA020.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00811","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"アメリカの移民","date":"2025-01-22T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"アメリカにいる「不法移民」はピュー・リサーチセンターの推計（2021年）で、約1050万人。労働力人口に占める比率は4・6%に上ります。法律を破って入国したとは限らず、最近は「書類のない移民（undocumented immigrants）」「資格のない移民（unauthorized immigrants）」とも呼ばれます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":484,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/america-imin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=260c8c76-2deb-43b7-920e-b20000567bdb","https://open.spotify.com/episode/6SHDnncJb1mCkyzkcYLZ2t","https://pca.st/episode/3b0ded4e-a001-46ee-8abb-6f18a0b2ec2c"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDN13LLRD7UHBI00Z.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】米国の移民問題とは 越境者が多様化、法改正は困難","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDN13LLRD7UHBI00Z.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00812","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"トランプ関税（2025年1月）","date":"2025-01-21T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"アメリカ大統領として再登板するトランプ氏は、すべての輸入品に10％以上、カナダとメキシコには25％、中国には60％もの関税をかけると公約しています。強行すれば、アメリカ自身も無傷ではいられません。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":867,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/tariff-man","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=76470172-07e6-4af9-931b-b268005dbf0d","https://open.spotify.com/episode/2vhYFAZfQLhA8zDZZ4BYXW","https://pca.st/episode/9f404878-213c-43e9-b7c9-0313a1630c63","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/ujhjlg6j"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST1H3SN2T1HUHBI01TM.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCD1JLJSCDUHBI00CM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"世界巻き込む「トランプ関税」中国、カナダ、メキシコ…そして日本も","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST1H3SN2T1HUHBI01TM.html"},{"title":"トランプ氏、中国製品に関税60%を強行？ 米国もただでは済まない","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCD1JLJSCDUHBI00CM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00813","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"韓国大統領の逮捕","date":"2025-01-20T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"歴史を振り返ると、韓国の大統領経験者は過去に計4人が逮捕されています。尹錫悦（ユンソンニョル）氏は5人目で、現職としては初めてのケースとなります。逮捕以外にも、亡命、暗殺、自殺という末路をたどった大統領経験者もいます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":615,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/korea-president-arrest","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=dd4c919c-7d5a-43b6-a37c-b261006eece1","https://open.spotify.com/episode/63W9vLu90zZjGZW0FJ8E4n","https://pca.st/episode/492a8c56-368c-40fe-a1c7-c4aeaf218e1c","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/bb4ni6oo"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSDX4S0ZSDXUHBI019M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】尹氏の拘束令状執行へ 韓国大統領、事件なぜ多い？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSDX4S0ZSDXUHBI019M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00814","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"災害時の心のケア","date":"2025-01-17T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"災害時の心のケアは、1995年の阪神・淡路大震災で注目されるようになりました。被災者の心の傷を放置すると様々な精神疾患につながりかねず、息の長い支援が求められます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":543,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kokoro-no-care","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=8db1b682-9a32-4d03-825e-b24800132c01","https://open.spotify.com/episode/6YNvnQhtcHmFP2lrAblpMT","https://pca.st/episode/317c6b1b-7499-49fe-b123-81420a0f5cc3","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/mgcpomao"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15865498.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）災害時の心の不調、長引くのを避けるには？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15865498.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00815","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"阪神・淡路大震災","date":"2025-01-16T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"阪神・淡路大震災は戦後初めて大都市を直下から襲った地震で、1995年1月17日午前5時46分に起きました。震源は兵庫県の淡路島北部で、神戸市など4市と淡路島で観測史上初の震度7を記録しました。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":694,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/hanshin-awaji-daishinsai","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=42b9be9d-9b03-4585-b4fd-b261006d5646","https://open.spotify.com/episode/21Llz0gY3w0LJdv5GKpnGw","https://pca.st/episode/79ee85df-4188-4d05-a427-c1c6dfa3764d","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/rrhp7oce"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16127886.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S14329766.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（社説）阪神大震災から３０年 住宅と生活の再建 問い直す","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16127886.html"},{"title":"（いちからわかる！）阪神・淡路大震災から２５年になるんだね","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S14329766.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00816","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"DEI（多様性・公平性・包摂性）","date":"2025-01-15T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"DEIとはDiversity（ダイバーシティー）・Equity（エクイティー）・Inclusion（インクルージョン）の頭文字を取った言葉です。指し示すのは、すべての人に公正な機会を与えることで、人々が不当に偏った状況におかれることなく多様な背景を受容できる社会の実現です。 DEIとは？ 注目される背景や経緯、企業事例を社労士が解説","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":875,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/dei","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=a3f03b7e-f1c9-461e-ac2b-b2610074021f","https://open.spotify.com/episode/1w2ES23HkFborBkCF5HrLu","https://pca.st/episode/7bd89791-11c6-4988-a547-e03c10c21b97"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST182S5XT18SFVU0PYM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"マクドナルド、多様性・公平性の目標廃止 トランプ氏の姿勢も背景に","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/AST182S5XT18SFVU0PYM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00817","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"女性の大学進学","date":"2025-01-14T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"戦前、旧制大学への入学資格は男子のみを受け入れる旧制高校卒業生に限られ、女子の進学の道はほとんど閉ざされていました。戦後の学制改革で男女共学が原則とされましたが、4年制大学への進学率は1973年に初めて1割を超えたものの、男子の3分の1程度でした。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":812,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/jyosei-shingaku","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=3598a91d-7921-4d91-a3d5-b20000584576","https://open.spotify.com/episode/5xNmyfPcPjTu2IsYnAkBNT","https://pca.st/episode/6459be95-4c94-4700-9f3b-e7402c527ba7","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/ogb2ug4b"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15927647.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）女性の大学進学、今でもハードルがある？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15927647.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00818","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"子育て支援金","date":"2025-01-10T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"子育て支援金は、児童手当の拡充（高校生年代までの支給期間の延長など）、保護者の就労要件を問わずに保育所などを利用できる「こども誰でも通園」制度などに使われます。政府が進める年3・6兆円規模の少子化対策財源の一つです。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":677,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kosodate-shienkin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=5b50e361-cc7a-45d6-aaaf-b20000584574","https://open.spotify.com/episode/2FVjig54d5zbjAsIGiPvWw","https://pca.st/episode/bed9781d-bebd-4b40-a863-63359bd25f9e","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/uvq43zss"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS551QR0S55UTFL00YM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】子育て「支援金」ってどんな仕組み？ 何に使うの？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS551QR0S55UTFL00YM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00819","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"ASEAN（東南アジア諸国連合）","date":"2025-01-09T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"ASEANは東南アジア10カ国の政府間組織です。1967年にインドネシア、タイ、マレーシア、フィリピン、シンガポールの5加盟国で発足。90年代以降、ベトナム、ラオス、ミャンマー、カンボジアが参加しました。東ティモールはオブザーバー参加ですが、2022年に加盟が原則承認されています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":596,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/asean","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=750ed1b8-f0b7-4ad0-af8e-b20000544842","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3IxYHW7XyMfisDCl7RQZn5","https://pca.st/episode/6e9269a2-c49f-4f1f-b984-d4b4be18840d","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/flreivll"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDB4H20RD5UHBI03D.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】日本とASEAN 「反日」から半世紀の道のりは","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDB4H20RD5UHBI03D.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00820","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"デジタル赤字","date":"2025-01-08T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"日本のGDPを押し下げる要因の一つに、デジタル化の進展で海外の巨大IT企業に支払うお金が増えていることがあります。これが「デジタル赤字」です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":681,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/digital-akaji","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=bb20a902-