ニュースの学校","title":"5類移行","date":"2024-12-31T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"感染症法は、感染の広がりの強さや、かかったときの重症度などで、感染症を1～5類に分けています。エボラ出血熱などの1類、結核などの2類は就業制限や入院勧告といった厳しい感染対策がとられます。一方、季節性インフルエンザなどの5類は学校の出席停止はありますが、感染対策は個人の判断です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":571,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/5rui-ikou","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=39fe7d33-3563-462c-9fd0-b2000053eb07","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3TxxwpAUuxFqI7bkEM1zTr","https://pca.st/episode/e39a58e4-15cb-4c9c-90a3-ddabf518a90f","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/qsmdn2vc"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS57441GS57UTFL01JM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】新型コロナの5類移行から1年 何が変わった？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS57441GS57UTFL01JM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00824","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"機能性表示食品","date":"2024-12-30T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"食品には健康に及ぼす機能性（効果）を表示できないことになっています。例外的に、保健機能食品という食品群だけが、機能性の表示を認められています。機能性表示食品は、この保健機能食品の1分野です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":545,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kinousei","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=2e62f11b-73e3-486c-891b-b2000057be8a","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4Jzi3jYd0zGbaoscFXyPZJ","https://pca.st/episode/9c5e9e31-039e-44b6-9235-e4bf6a2152d0","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/n7mohnft"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS3W3HRYS3WUTFL00BM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】機能性表示食品とは？トクホとの違いは？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS3W3HRYS3WUTFL00BM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00825","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"生活保護","date":"2024-12-27T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"生活保護とは、仕事を失ったり病気などで暮らしが行き詰まったときに使える制度です。社会保障の「最後のセーフティーネット（安全網）」と呼ばれています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":696,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/seikatuhogo","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=17e9cff6-0b3b-4e8a-aabd-b24800121600","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3LPj3A0aIYAzIcZwAi3CP4","https://pca.st/episode/b35c3f6d-3aec-4c3b-a65f-85b2bffe2194"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCG1C7RSCGUTFL00CM.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR3S7QSMR3JUTNB01S.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】「最後の安全網」生活保護申請のハードルとは？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCG1C7RSCGUTFL00CM.html"},{"title":"【そもそも解説】生活保護の扶養照会、誰が照会対象？何を聞かれる？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR3S7QSMR3JUTNB01S.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00826","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"基地の騒音訴訟","date":"2024-12-26T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"全国にある自衛隊やアメリカ軍の基地では、離着陸する航空機の騒音が問題となってきました。各地で損害賠償や飛行の差し止めを求める訴訟が起こされています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":565,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kichi-souon","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=471e1957-1200-4685-a8eb-b23d0033cd1f","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4AVFE84nmbGOkyWhhZ2ZBp","https://pca.st/episode/991aadba-58f9-424b-87fe-cc4127d2fd55","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/m4n9wqsu"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCM25SHSCMOXIE00QM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】基地の騒音訴訟、どこで起き、裁判所はどんな判断?","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCM25SHSCMOXIE00QM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00827","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"弾劾","date":"2024-12-25T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"韓国の尹錫悦（ユンソンニョル）大統領に対する弾劾訴追案の採決が12月14日、国会で可決されました。憲法裁判所の弾劾審判で180日以内に罷免するかどうかを判断します。罷免が決まった場合、60日以内に大統領選が行われます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":820,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/dangai","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=4e575505-eb5f-41ab-8175-b24a007d7bb8","https://open.spotify.com/episode/5wQ8GUavb2caIZdM8rGjAR","https://pca.st/episode/eb50f4cc-7eee-405c-9350-52e19d5d6e37","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/atjuwzh5"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD7164SSD7UHBI03FM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】韓国・尹錫悦大統領への弾劾案可決 今後どうなる？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD7164SSD7UHBI03FM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00828","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"悪質ホストクラブ","date":"2024-12-24T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"ホストクラブは男性が女性を接客する店のこと。10代後半～20代前半の女性客に、支払い能力を超えた高額の売掛金（ツケ）を負わせ、売春に誘導するケースが問題化しています。ホストと恋愛関係にあると信じ込ませる例が多いとされています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":619,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/akushitsu-hostclub","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=a0777824-6331-4e1d-af3b-b20000576dec","https://open.spotify.com/episode/6VqOqTO80uAtskDhgkq2c1","https://pca.st/episode/8092c697-1d94-4f9f-a856-ebeb34363849","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/efqumfgj"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15803531.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）悪質ホストクラブ、売掛金の仕組みは？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15803531.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00829","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"型式指定","date":"2024-12-23T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"自動車の販売時に、1台ずつ国の検査を受けるのは大変な手間です。そこで、メーカーが車種やエンジンごとにサンプルを使って性能などを確かめる試験を行い、データを国に提出。審査に合格すれば型式指定を受けられ、1台ずつ検査しなくてもよくなります。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":693,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/katashiki","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=70a1309e-7201-4e05-bbed-b2000057ff3d","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4aS7T2nwIiBRBgcc9b48CO","https://pca.st/episode/62eef913-5033-409a-8c50-3c797c6cd877","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/mghzcbly"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15950248.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）「型式指定」の制度とは？取り消された場合は？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15950248.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00830","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"自動車業界の再編","date":"2024-12-20T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"ホンダと日産自動車が経営統合に向けて協議入りする方向になりました。自動車メーカーはこれまでも、さまざまなグループの形成と解消を繰り返してきました。とりわけ有名なのは、1998年のダイムラー・ベンツ（当時）とクライスラーの合併です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":742,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/jidousya-saihen","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=8819a410-8ec7-4e5e-8f4e-b24b00625f71","https://open.spotify.com/episode/7z3RXNvQlfhKsVMic0l2yL","https://pca.st/episode/ccaa764b-b5d8-4388-988e-5bf663c6207e"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSDL42VTSDLULFA02TM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】車業界の合従連衡の歴史 次世代技術で潮目に変化","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSDL42VTSDLULFA02TM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00831","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"日本版DBS","date":"2024-12-19T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"子どもと接する職場に、従業員らの性犯罪歴を確認させ、事実上就労を制限する――。政府は、「日本版DBS」とも呼ばれる新制度の創設を盛り込んだ「こども性暴力防止法案」を閣議決定しました。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":517,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nihonban-dbs","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=3f76edd5-b37d-4d9e-80ae-b20000593be7","https://open.spotify.com/episode/41ts7vTLsWZpgI2LNec5Hp","https://pca.st/episode/c3b5d846-82a8-4b73-8fb8-7ccad93a3ee3"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR9V5CTZR9DUTFL01B.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】「日本版DBS」 性犯罪歴どう確認する？対象は？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR9V5CTZR9DUTFL01B.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00832","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"検索連動型広告","date":"2024-12-18T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"検索連動型広告とは、インターネットの検索サイトなどで、利用者が検索した内容に関連して表示される広告のことです。多くの場合、検索結果ページの上部や下部に「スポンサー」などと併記されて表示されます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":794,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kensaku-rendo","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=1a718390-76dd-4d93-98a4-b2000057ff3d","https://open.spotify.com/episode/5KZI49ZlA7Eav62iImF5Bs","https://pca.st/episode/371c23a5-89e2-4c9a-b57f-dd5555d4044e","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/4cirzwvi"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS4Q1FRQS4QUTIL00FM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】検索連動型広告とは？1兆円市場、グーグルが独占か","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS4Q1FRQS4QUTIL00FM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00833","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"人口減少","date":"2024-12-17T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"日本の人口が減っています。低出生率が続いているからです。理由は多岐にわたりますが、人生観や結婚観の変化、産業構造の転換、子育てコストの上昇、女性の社会進出と性別役割分業意識、経済的格差の拡大などが挙げられています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":698,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/jinko-gensho","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=dd4457ee-e199-4865-b912-b2000058ea87","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4FuDYjZTfnhGpcTIWSPEbR","https://pca.st/episode/a2f61863-7181-4fb9-9752-c8869231076e","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/hzb3cstp"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS4S0V1CS4SUPQJ008M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】「消滅可能性」とは？ どうして人口が減っている？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS4S0V1CS4SUPQJ008M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00834","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"南海トラフ地震","date":"2024-12-16T06:11:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"フィリピン海プレートとユーラシアプレートが接する海底の深い溝を南海トラフと呼びます。二つのプレート境界では、沈み込みでひずみがたまり、限界に達して跳ね上がることで大きな地震が繰り返し発生しています。これが南海トラフ地震です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":516,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nankai-trough","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=c448e865-750a-4d6a-8c28-b20000593be0","https://open.spotify.com/episode/2V2jpNTeA6CSiVxm1POi6K","https://pca.st/episode/88a442d2-1b63-4318-af48-19d836d7f2f2","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/srgigt7u"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS8020SYS80UTIL021M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】南海トラフ地震とは 繰り返し発生、高まる切迫性","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS8020SYS80UTIL021M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00835","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"子どもの権利条約","date":"2024-12-16T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"子どもの権利条約は、すべての子どもの権利を保障するために、1989年11月20日に国連でつくられました。「児童の権利に関する条約」とも呼ばれています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":551,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/rights-of-the-child","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=be9ad86c-e991-4e4c-b566-b23d003f6e90","https://open.spotify.com/episode/0sGT0PE7kGVFehKU31KOjw","https://pca.st/episode/399442cc-8fe6-44a9-809a-87c9f22ad108","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/cqimiovt"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCM154VSCMUTFL002M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】紛争や虐待相次ぐ今こそ知りたい 子どもの権利条約","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSCM154VSCMUTFL002M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00836","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"企業献金","date":"2024-12-13T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"政治家個人への企業・団体献金は禁止されたはずですが、政治家個人が代表を務める政党支部への献金は認められています。企業が政治家に提供したお金をめぐる事件が相次ぎ、政治不信を招いて政治資金規正法が見直されてきた経緯を振り返ります。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":609,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kigyo-kenkin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=3bfea267-34a5-4afd-9b3f-b2000057be85","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4b1ivkYdVzjibMTRrGkV9B","https://pca.st/episode/7c536bff-216a-4bd6-9c42-58455934485b"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS2K6F2JS24ULFA001.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】企業から「政党支部」への献金、なぜ認められる？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS2K6F2JS24ULFA001.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00837","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"オスプレイ","date":"2024-12-12T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"オスプレイは輸送機で、両翼の先端についているプロペラ部分の向きが変えられます。上に向けてヘリのように垂直に離着陸したり、前に傾けて固定翼機のように高速で飛んだりできます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":410,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/osprey","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=bc2e4bd1-3faa-4683-a0fe-b20000567beb","https://open.spotify.com/episode/66VcrLIJLac4f0HL1LxCRo","https://pca.st/episode/119ce89b-a666-49be-9872-0aaf9f9dbe89","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/x2baczlu"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRCZ74KXRCZUTIL01X.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】オスプレイとは？ ヘリより高性能、深刻な事故も","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRCZ74KXRCZUTIL01X.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00838","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"核兵器","date":"2024-12-11T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"核兵器は、物質の「核」を次々に分裂させる「核分裂」や融合させる「核融合」のしくみを使い、巨大なエネルギーを瞬時に放出させる兵器のことです。アメリカ軍が広島と長崎に落とした原子爆弾（原爆）や、アメリカや旧ソ連が実験した水素爆弾（水爆）を指します。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":834,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nuclear-weapon","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=abb965cd-5da0-4b00-8a0c-b235006a9ec8","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4XesnBwCJ8qrPFHKUFEPxN","https://pca.st/episode/089f66da-2933-4f30-aefc-7f373460757e","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/kfknqpoh"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR894W0QR84TIPE018.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】核兵器とほかの兵器の違い、三つの特徴","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASR894W0QR84TIPE018.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00839","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"ノーベル平和賞","date":"2024-12-10T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"ノーベル平和賞は1901年に始まり、国際紛争の解決、人道支援、軍縮・核不拡散の促進、人権や環境を守る活動などに尽くした個人や団体が、これまで受賞してきました。2023年まで104回、111の個人と30団体が受賞しています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":777,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nobel-peace-prize","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=8968c01a-4005-4591-87c0-b235006acd62","https://open.spotify.com/episode/0Jzo9JGQmH3SB0lmTZQA2H","https://pca.st/episode/e7955042-ecce-4b7a-9b0c-d4bd9a1b8544","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/ptgpowiq"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSBB2DZ6SBBUHBI012M.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRB566G9RB4UHBI00W.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】ノーベル平和賞、どんな人に？ 授賞に疑問や反発も","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSBB2DZ6SBBUHBI012M.html"},{"title":"【そもそも解説】ノーベル平和賞、どう選ばれる？最年少受賞は17歳","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRB566G9RB4UHBI00W.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00840","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"シリア内戦","date":"2024-12-09T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"膠着状態が続いていたシリア内戦が最大の転機を迎えました。アサド政権が軍事的な優位を固めていましたが、反体制派が電撃的な攻勢に出て、一気に首都ダマスカスに達し、「アサド政権からの解放」を宣言しました。2011年の混乱から複雑化した内戦の経緯と現状を整理します。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":1004,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/syria-naisen","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=d8dccbcf-dca8-4b61-b0b6-b24000b28c26","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3dnpOsQ0FTFYIagQJdam78","https://pca.st/episode/501ee96e-cb21-4bce-ba50-cfcd842f0500"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD12544SD1UHBI014M.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】シリア内戦が最大の転機 いつ、なぜ始まった？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD12544SD1UHBI014M.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00841","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"戒厳（非常戒厳・戒厳令）","date":"2024-12-06T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"韓国憲法第77条は、大統領は、戦時などの国家非常事態や、公共の安寧と秩序を維持する必要があるとき、戒厳を宣布することができるなどと定めています。言論・出版・集会・結社の自由などについて、特別な措置をとることができます。一方、国会が在籍議員過半数の賛成で戒厳の解除を要求したとき、大統領は解除しなければならないとしています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":931,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kaigen","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=3785b64f-2ea9-4349-988d-b23d002ab8cc","https://open.spotify.com/episode/7t0n8gG3yhzCob5agIELqK","https://pca.st/episode/3c4778c2-bf5b-40ca-83b6-47be6ee513ef","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/jafdreyt"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15311443.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16099533.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）韓国の「光州事件」何があったの？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15311443.html"},{"title":"（時時刻刻）戒厳、押し切った末 軍政下以来の事態、与党議員も解除に賛成 韓国","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16099533.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00842","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"国民負担率","date":"2024-12-05T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"国民負担率とは、税と社会保障の負担割合を表す指標です。個人や企業の収入をあわせた「国民所得」を分母に、税と社会保障の負担を分子として計算します。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":685,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/kokumin-futanritsu","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=2952d5d5-9a0c-4ff2-81f2-b2000057ff42","https://open.spotify.com/episode/0lIuZ9pGMZ3G55ANXiYyAf","https://pca.st/episode/8874c71e-40a4-4919-9d44-b63f76b2866a","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/ejbzydtc"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDP51Q7RDPUTFL00H.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】少子化対策は追加負担ゼロ？ 国民負担率で考えると","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASRDP51Q7RDPUTFL00H.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00843","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"尹錫悦（ユンソンニョル）韓国大統領","date":"2024-12-04T15:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"尹錫悦氏は1960年、ソウル生まれ。有力な政治指導者がいなかった保守勢力が、「反文在寅氏の象徴」として担ぎだし、2022年5月の大統領選では僅差で勝利しました。政治家としての経験がないため、当初から人脈や指導力が不安視されていました。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":997,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/yoon-suk-yeol","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=9265293f-a400-43a2-aca4-b23c0051ddbf","https://open.spotify.com/episode/37n76qhw1dqWO8Ne5ljxge","https://pca.st/episode/73010786-5dd3-4e65-a3b2-4f801af35166","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/lpqvgkme"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD40D5RSD4UHBI00QM.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15298173.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"尹大統領とは何者か 酒豪の親日家、検察出身で「友達人事」に批判も","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSD40D5RSD4UHBI00QM.html"},{"title":"（いちからわかる！）韓国に新しい大統領、何が変わるの？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S15298173.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00844","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"身元保証人","date":"2024-12-04T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"病院や高齢者施設への入院や入所に際し、身元保証人を求められることがあります。法的に定められたものではありません。費用の支払いが滞ったときに払ってくれ、本人の死亡後に遺体の引き取りなどをしてくれる人を確保したい、といった意味合いが強いようです。「身元引受人」などと言われる場合もあります。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":480,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/mimoto-hosyounin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=ce344380-f0cd-46c0-9fe2-b22e00491e87","https://open.spotify.com/episode/0LOWwqlbf09zNxJ0YBgNfb","https://pca.st/episode/cfd14de9-ca17-489d-bc79-ba728358b0b4","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/iohredfz"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16076245.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS7Z5H53S7ZUTFL00RM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）身元保証人、どんなことをする？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16076245.html"},{"title":"【そもそも解説】「高齢者等終身サポート事業者ガイドライン」とは？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS7Z5H53S7ZUTFL00RM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00845","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"猟友会","date":"2024-12-03T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"猟友会は、狩猟免許を所持する狩猟者（ハンター）による趣味の団体です。全国組織の大日本猟友会のほか、各都道府県や市町村にもあります。所属しなくても狩猟はできますが、狩猟登録などの手続きを代行してくれます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":733,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/ryoyukai","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=aa6f4048-f7d0-48e7-a22e-b235006ad96f","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4l4m8WWGQmknXwD9zWc2PZ","https://pca.st/episode/de8ca4e1-d58b-4618-a367-bec43de5403a"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16092684.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"（いちからわかる！）猟友会って、どんな団体？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/DA3S16092684.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00846","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"PFAS（有機フッ素化合物）","date":"2024-12-02T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"PFASは、世界中で約4700種類あるとされる有機フッ素化合物の総称です。ペルフルオロオクタンスルホン酸（PFOS〈ピーフォス〉）とペルフルオロオクタン酸（PFOA〈ピーフォア〉）が代表例。水や油をはじき、熱に強い性質があります。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":702,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/pfas","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=7c9b7323-79d0-49e9-bed0-b20000551a5f","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3j9RvB11NYX3G15EDu8LO3","https://pca.st/episode/47f9f7ad-8a1b-4420-9651-a8bc6608998b","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/chy8pxmk"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS254DB9S10TPOB002.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】PFASとは？各地で検出相次ぐ、健康への影響指摘","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS254DB9S10TPOB002.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00847","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"マイナ保険証","date":"2024-11-29T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"杢田光","description":"マイナ保険証とは、マイナンバーカードを健康保険証として登録し、病院や薬局などで使えるようにする仕組みです。政府は2024年12月2日から、今までのような保険証を新たに発行することをやめ、マイナ保険証への切り替えを促しています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":521,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/maina-hokensho","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=a65a2187-6063-40d9-b5be-b22d002c2fd4","https://open.spotify.com/episode/0r9knA058bXWnfGOBNrqHS","https://pca.st/episode/80b9090d-aa53-4622-b50f-574e111ea501","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/moznyly1"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSB03FXTSB0UTFL00KM.html","https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSB03DB3SB0UTFL00RM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】あと1カ月でマイナ保険証に移行、どうして？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSB03FXTSB0UTFL00KM.html"},{"title":"現行の保険証「廃止」でどうなる？ マイナ保険証の有無、年齢別では","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASSB03DB3SB0UTFL00RM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00848","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"マイナンバー制度","date":"2024-11-28T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"マイナンバーとは日本に住む一人ひとりに12桁の数字を自動で割り振る仕組みで、2015年から始まりました。番号が流出して不正に使われる恐れがあるときを除いて、生涯変わりません。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":635,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/my-number","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=d5d99b29-856e-4124-8c35-b20000570a3b","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4iMFFkR4xQuRWN5zZQTfYw","https://pca.st/episode/7b65a15d-1c90-422a-b15a-6e5a42481bcd","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/a89mqv0c"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS5H3T75S5HULFA02DM.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"【そもそも解説】マイナンバー制度って？ マイナカードとの違いは？","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS5H3T75S5HULFA02DM.html"}]},{"id":"EP-00849","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"日経平均","date":"2024-11-27T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"神田大介","description":"日経平均株価は、日本を代表する大企業225銘柄の株価をもとに算出した指数です。多くの企業の株価の平均を取れば、日本企業全体の好不調を知る目安になるとの考えから広く活用されてきました。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":837,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nikkei-heikin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=aca9ffb2-b159-4912-af3c-b20000593bdf","https://open.spotify.com/episode/7vTJ6VzN1utHViqfT9WQGa","https://pca.st/episode/98f7b87e-b5aa-4148-a805-fc388e8328de"],"related":["https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS2Q5SMYS2NULFA012.html"],"relatedArticles":[{"title":"「日経平均=日本企業の現状」とは言い切れない TOPIXとの違い","url":"https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASS2Q5SMYS2NULFA012.html"}]}]
